LOCATION:Tampa \, FL United States
DESCRIPTION:TAMPA CITY COUNCIL NOTICE OF PUBLIC MEETING SPECIAL CALL SESSI
 ON Date: Tuesday\, November 17\, 2026 Time: 1:30 p.m. Location: City Counc
 il Chambers Old City Hall\, 3rd Floor 315 E. Kennedy Blvd. Tampa FL 33602 
 Agenda: https:tampa.govagendas (https:tampa.govagendas) The purpose of thi
 s Special Call Session is for City Council to appoint the District 7 repre
 sentative for the remainder of the term. The public and citizens of the Ci
 ty of Tampa will be able to watch\, listen or view this meeting on: Cable 
 TV: Spectrum Channel 640 Frontier Channel 15 Internet: https:www.tampa.gov
 livestream (https:www.tampa.govlivestream) Public Comment\, limited to the
  subject of the Special Call Session\, will be accepted at the start of th
 e meeting\, three minutes per speaker. PRE-REGISTRATION IS REQUIRED TO SPE
 AK REMOTELY DURING PUBLIC COMMENT WITH THE USE OF CMT: Complete the form a
 t https:www.tampa.govPublicComment (https:www.tampa.govPublicComment) AND 
 state on the form under Request Type that you wish to speak live during th
 e public comment period. You will then be contacted with additional instru
 ctions on how to participate live through the use of CMT. Registration for
